SUMMARY:Collage Capsules: Build a Mini Museum
LOCATION:Downtown Library\, 270 Forest Ave.\, Palo Alto\, CA
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/collage-capsules-build-mini-museum/
DESCRIPTION:Craft + Museum exhibits\nhttps://sf.funcheap.com/collage-capsu
 les-build-mini-museum/\n\nParticipants transform an ordinary Altoid tin i
 nto a miniature museum exhibit or tiny library bookshelf using vintage-in
 spired collage materials\, tiny treasures and unique ephemera. No art exp
 erience is needed\, and each attendee leaves with a one-of-a-kind mini cr
 eation. The workshop runs Friday\, November 6\, 3:30–5:30 PM at Downtow
 n Library\, 270 Forest Ave.\, Palo Alto. Admission is free.
